    "body": "## DEFERRED — PIXELCONTROL RESEARCH IS NOT CURRENT P01 WORK\n\nThis PR is bounded research and explicitly states that real diffusion runtime, production visual quality, backend leakage, seam/background continuity and VRAM remain NOT PROVEN/UNKNOWN, with no image generation/editing performed.\n\nFresh #251 has `ACTIVE_PHASE = P01 PROJECT PLANNING`; tool/backend research is not required to complete P01 and must not become a competing NEXT.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `DEFERRED / REUSABLE RESEARCH`. Preserve all sigma/provenance evidence for a future phase that actually selects a diffusion route.",
