    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Scope\nCloses one concrete static reproducibility gap from the durable PixelControl chain: R16 left `SIGMA_VECTOR = NOT PROVEN`.\n\n## HARD OSS-FIRST evidence\n- pinned Diffusers: `c1bf18c92c6285334adcaac7e75ef8946a227f49` / `0.41.0.dev0` / Apache-2.0\n- fresh Diffusers main: `2e618cb6027037597cf80905fc3e356a71923087`\n- selected SDXL inpaint pipeline blob unchanged: `3f18cbe21d0fe12f89859d188dba2a487f3d87c5`\n- Euler scheduler blob unchanged: `eac6efe18aaf775b846e7536fd972686d3ec9683`\n- Euler upstream tests blob unchanged: `ee99465abfc39e7a7ce7a6734b22dbeb42df5efd`\n\n## New exact control evidence\n- binds sigma-affecting defaults that R16 did not make explicit (`trained_betas=None`, `rescale_betas_zero_snr=False`, no exponential/beta sigmas, `final_sigmas_type=zero`, `timestep_type=discrete`)\n- derives the exact source-equivalent float32 scheduler receipt on the measured CPU host\n- full 21-value LE-f32 SHA-256: `dd2b4c6776c6cad5ddb460a30f3906d4ccb3b1f694bf9e6e9e89a2dba07d578f`\n- effective 19 denoise-sigma SHA-256: `e03af84d27673cb3cd8226551a084405224f01ead40a3ccc6c0189b993da24ec`\n- successor-sigma SHA-256: `600d524c9374a76235a04b0665cfdf03752792232a57b4f2d402ceabf8a1a1e2`\n- proves `strength=0.99` sets `begin_index=1`: timestep 951 sigma is skipped; timestep 901 sigma (`8.390686988830566`, LE `41400641`) is used for both initial `add_noise()` and first Euler step; last successor is exact zero.\n\n## Verification\n- R20: 13/13 PASS\n- R16 regression: 10/10 PASS\n- compileall: PASS\n\n## Truth boundary\nThis is **not** a real diffusion-runtime PASS. Current host remains Torch `2.10.0+cpu`, CUDA unavailable, Diffusers absent. `TARGET_R17_SIGMA_FINGERPRINT`, real backend leakage, real FREE seam/background continuity, minimum VRAM, production visual quality remain NOT PROVEN/UNKNOWN. No image generation/editing. No ControlNet/depth/edge addition.\n\nThe selected model/license is unchanged; fresh Hugging Face model-card recheck still reports `openrail++` / CreativeML Open RAIL++-M. R20 makes no new legal interpretation.",
